[{"title":"寄远曲","author":"胡奎","text":"美人别后关山长，买丝绣得金鸳鸯。\n鸳鸯交颈不飞去，与郎缝作征衣裳。\n长长搓线莫教短，短线恐郎情易断。\n衣成更写数行书，书中泪是蛟人珠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55818,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"懊恼曲","author":"胡奎","text":"懊恼复懊恼，懊恼无人知。\n阿婆不嫁女，夜夜守空闺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55819,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吟叹曲","author":"胡奎","text":"王子乔，好神仙，吹玉笙，上青天。\n七月七日缑山颠，青鸾白鹤相后先。\n安得金丹蜕凡骨，我亦从之凌紫烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55820,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双凫曲","author":"胡奎","text":"江上春生蒲叶短，双凫昼卧晴沙暖。\n一声欸乃钓船归，锦翼斑斑相逐飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55821,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸡鸣曲三首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"晨鸡初鸣当夜半，少妇出房愁思乱。\n晨鸡再鸣月入帷，少妇出门郎马嘶。\n晨鸡三鸣月在道，道上马嘶声渐杳。\n马嘶渐杳鸡乱鸣，桃灯泣泪天未明。\n后夜闻鸡北窗下，梦里鸡声候郎马。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55822,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸡鸣曲三首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"一鸣六龙海波赤，再鸣旸谷东方白。\n三鸣阊阖参差开，紫云飞绕金银台。\n天街夜夜鸡鸣早，珂佩朝回霜满道。\n绮疏花影晏眠人，梦里鸡声不知晓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55823,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸡鸣曲三首 其三","author":"胡奎","text":"晨鸡初鸣月在堂，少妇挑灯开洞房。\n晨鸡再鸣月在树，门前马嘶郎欲去。\n城西月落鸡三鸣，出户不闻郎马声。\n马声已远鸡声静，回首不知郎远近。\n寄语晨鸡休浪啼，啼时愿郎归马嘶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55824,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乌栖曲","author":"胡奎","text":"今夜乌栖向何处，哑哑飞绕深宫树。\n宫中美人醉不醒，空劳尔乌啼到明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55825,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乌啼曲","author":"胡奎","text":"秦乌哑哑啼复啼，夜夜不离庭树枝。\n妾听乌啼识乌意，明日官家赦书至。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55826,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"城乌曲","author":"胡奎","text":"乌啼城上树，飞来复飞去。\n乌去有时来，郎今在何处。\n月出女墙头，乌啼碧树秋。\n哑哑声不断，啼月过西楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55827,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别鹤曲","author":"胡奎","text":"缟素作衣丹作顶，夜夜月明看舞影。\n今朝童子起开笼，不闻戛戛回天风。\n缑山仙人吹凤琯，八极无尘綵云断。\n何由振羽当我前，借骑一只蓬莱天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55828,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"骢马曲","author":"胡奎","text":"御史骢，青连钱，嘶风刷电朝九天。\n昨日街头人避马，今朝喋血车轮下。\n后夜鸡鸣闻曙钟，绣衣又复骑青骢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55829,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迎龙曲","author":"胡奎","text":"朝迎龙，暮迎龙，旱火烧天龙在宫。\n县官投牒石潭中，山南山北鼓逢逢。\n蜿蜒跃入杨枝水，山云一缕随龙起。\n龙未离山雨到城，城中三日不得晴。\n明朝打鼓送龙去，愿龙十日行一雨。\n种田有水刈麦乾，年年谢龙神亦欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55830,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送龙曲","author":"胡奎","text":"迎龙来，送龙去，翠雾红云拥龙驭。\n家家买纸谢龙神，甘雨应期龙有灵。\n明珠之宫紫贝阙，碧潭无声湛秋月。\n愿龙在山云在天，岁岁谢龙歌有年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55831,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乌栖曲","author":"胡奎","text":"城头月明乌夜栖，栖到天明啼复啼。\n底事夜栖朝复去，不识朝阳凤凰树。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55832,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迎龙词","author":"胡奎","text":"鼍鼓逢逢，龙在王宫。\n电虩虩，云重重。\n启贝阙，精诚通。\n驱五雷，招八风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55833,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送龙词","author":"胡奎","text":"龙之来，兮蜿蜒。\n龙之去，兮连蜷。\n沛神泽兮沃秋田，云为车兮电为鞭。\n陈玉醴，进琼筵，感神惠兮不可言。\n愿五风，兮十雨，绥万邦兮屡丰年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55834,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白鹦鹉词","author":"胡奎","text":"白鹦鹉，陇西来，金笼驯养无人开。\n绮窗谈舌学人语，字字分明如处女。\n一朝持入沈香亭，玉环自教蜜多经。\n解听月殿霓裳曲，惯识梨园羯鼓声。\n无端羽化冲霄去，?在碧桃花落处。\n陇头迢遰陇云深，无复重栖旧时树。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55835,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山鹧鸪词 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"劝郎莫过洞庭湖，湘妃庙前啼鹧鸪。\n可恨九嶷山隔断，翠华无处问苍梧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55836,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山鹧鸪词 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"江上有山复有山，鹧鸪啼处雨斑斑。\n一声两声行不得，南船北船朝暮还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55837,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"精卫词","author":"胡奎","text":"精卫精卫飞且鸣，千年填海海不平。\n世传此是炎帝女，不知何年填海水。\n海山石烂海水枯，是时精卫安得无。\n如何精卫鸟，只填东海水。\n海水尚可填，人心浩无底。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55838,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鲛人词","author":"胡奎","text":"并刀翻水凝不流，碧绡如烟张素秋。\n蛟人夜织鱼鳞屋，月色澄澄湛寒绿。\n卖绡来从城市居，主翁不识明月珠。\n明珠赠君世无价，明年有绡复来卖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55839,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蚕簇词","author":"胡奎","text":"拜蚕室，祭神桑，吴蚕在箔神在堂。\n愿神佑蚕风日好，取茧倍多蚕缕长。\n十日天阴未开箔，蚕吐丝迟茧还薄。\n地炉火煖借春回，再祷神蚕须急作。\n缫车易转茧易抽，长丝满桁晴不收。\n新妇登堂向姑道，今岁衣姑丝不少。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55840,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"神树词","author":"胡奎","text":"田家种田无五行，屋西神树生有灵。\n年年祭树卜水旱，祈雨即雨晴须晴。\n鸡豚拜扫无閒日，乌鹊群飞来啄食。\n剪纸作钱挂树枝，祝田有来蚕有丝。\n收麦上场神得食，缫丝纳官神得衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55841,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田家词","author":"胡奎","text":"村巷深深枣花落，少妇缫丝催织作。\n上堂正恐阿婆瞋，不愤田头叫姑恶。\n大儿翻垄牵疲牛，小儿作军边上头。\n今年雨多麦穗黑，较比上年无半收。\n白头不愿识官府，但愿有租应门户。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55842,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔父词 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"家住琴江江，上头拓卦洲。\n前春水流桂，枝楫木兰舟。\n终日忘鱼不下钩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55843,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔父词 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"侬是烟波一钓徒，持竿东海拂珊瑚。\n女儿港，番君湖，浪静风恬过小孤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55844,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔父词 其三","author":"胡奎","text":"黄梅岭下是侬家，白石矶边把钓车。\n友麋鹿，侣鱼虾，不在山颠即水涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55845,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔父词 其四","author":"胡奎","text":"大江西去是，庐山云白山。\n青罨画间彭，蠡泽海门关。\n莫待风波及早还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55846,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔父词 其五","author":"胡奎","text":"白石矶头春水流，朝朝暮暮伴沙鸥。\n山渺渺，水悠悠，笑杀磻溪下直钩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55847,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔父词 其六","author":"胡奎","text":"磻溪野老发垂肩，钓得周家八百年。\n鱼换酒，不论钱，醒即长歌醉即眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55848,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仙人词","author":"胡奎","text":"金鳌背上蕊珠宫，千岁桃花几度红。\n曾见茂陵松柏下，铜仙清泪落秋风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55849,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋胡词","author":"胡奎","text":"陌头桑叶春阴阴，少妇采桑多苦心。\n朝来出门日已晏，蚕饥叶稀姑未饭。\n少年骑马桑间来，黄金不博笑颜开。\n但令人似秋胡妇，世上黄金不如土。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55850,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴女词二首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"吴中女儿绝可怜，裁得春衫称少年。\n身未嫁夫无处著，至今留在母床边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55851,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴女词二首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"二八吴女儿，画桨摇春煖。\n贪看双鸳鸯，采菱归日晚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55852,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"征妇词","author":"胡奎","text":"妾身愿如弓上弦，万里随郎长在边。\n郎身莫如弦上箭，一去无还不相见。\n堂上阿婆今白头，妾守空闺郎远游。\n请郎看取门前树，上有慈乌不飞去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55853,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"去妇词三首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"出户心悄悄，中情向谁道。\n吞声不敢啼，又恐傍人笑。\n妾有嫁时镜，请郎留自照。\n镜里见新人，还思旧人貌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55854,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"去妇词三首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"东山生兔丝，西山生蒺藜。\n二物不相偶，美恶人自知。\n妾有堂上姑，妾有怀中儿。\n生儿未及长，姑老将何依。\n妾今别夫去，裴回向何处。\n他日黄泉相见时，墓前莫种相思树。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55855,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"去妇词三首 其三","author":"胡奎","text":"妾去何足惜，妾留不自安。\n高堂有老姑，孰知饥与寒。\n妾昔念有家，妾今如风花。\n何如千尺松，而不附女萝。\n哀哀别姑去，泪下不能语。\n姑若念妾时，看取床头女。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55856,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"老妇叹镜词二首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"妾有团团古时镜，在匣浑如月端正。\n朝朝持向玉台前，秋水芙蓉两相映。\n自从十五画脩蛾，白发相看尘渐多。\n绣得合欢双宝带，今朝携上街头卖。\n满城新镜照新人，此镜无人定高价。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55857,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"老妇叹镜词二首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"妾有团团嫁时镜，比似青天月端正。\n少年锦带绣芙蓉，照妾颜色如花红。\n妾今对镜头如雪，辜负青天端正月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55858,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"明镜词","author":"胡奎","text":"我有古时镜，照君玉雪颜。\n湛然如止水，终古无波澜。\n世人但照面，照心不自见。\n照面不照心，妍媸竟何辨。\n所以百鍊精，鬼神无遁情。\n愿为千里月，远近逐君行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55859,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"照镜词","author":"胡奎","text":"颜看镜中红，发看镜中白。\n如何一寸心，镜中看不得。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55860,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"照镜词赠镊工潘郎","author":"胡奎","text":"潘郎买得扬州镜，团团比似扬州月。\n持向扬州住十年，旦暮照人头上雪。\n明月楼前问月人，琼花观里赏花春。\n回头不觉红颜改，对面应嗟白发新。\n男儿立功当及早，莫向潘郎镜中老。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55861,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白苧词三首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"剪冰绡，缝雪缕，馆娃宫人越溪女。\n回风吹雪长袖举，玉阶缤纷落花舞。\n白月堕地星河高，流云卷空翻翠涛，宫门鱼钥夜迢迢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55862,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白苧词三首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"绿窗樱桃花乱飞，美人当窗缝舞衣。\n纤歌窈窕扬蛾眉，鸾停鹄立佩陆离。\n馆娃宫深更漏稀，北斗斜挂宫门西，觚棱渐明乌人啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55863,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白苧词三首 其三","author":"胡奎","text":"浣纱女儿颜如花，一朝进入吴王家。\n吴王宫中歌白苧，水殿芙蓉不知暑。\n翔鸾舞鹄雪满堂，回风吹花响屧廊。\n宫门乌啼更漏长，曈曈旭日生榑桑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55864,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"焦尾词","author":"胡奎","text":"龙门千尺桐，化为爨下焦。\n不遇蔡中郎，大音终寂寥。\n所以九苞凤，千年鸣一朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55865,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"团扇词二首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"明月有时缺，团扇空自圆。\n月缺终还满，扇圆仍弃捐。\n不如秋水镜，长挂玉台前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55866,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"团扇词二首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"团扇团如白玉盘，玉盘比似月团团。\n早知玉树秋风近，不把閒愁写素纨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55867,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"香风词","author":"胡奎","text":"洛阳万花如锦机，春风吹上绣罗衣。\n日高走马章台路，蛱蝶一双相逐飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55868,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜词","author":"胡奎","text":"大江春水流汤汤，中有万斛之龙骧。\n南北二斗相低昂，泰阶六符白煌煌。\n牵牛织女遥相望，欲渡不渡河无梁。\n我思美人天一方，展转不寐愁何长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55869,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游春词","author":"胡奎","text":"杏雨不沾泥，流莺恰恰啼。\n弯弓驰紫陌，跃马过金堤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55870,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乞巧词","author":"胡奎","text":"平生甘抱拙，何用天孙巧。\n不知柳柳州，年年乞多少。\n天孙今夜渡天河，人言天上巧最多。\n妾今抱拙不求巧，愿赐拙多宁巧少。\n东家巧女如凤凰，罗襦绣得金鸳鸯。\n少年嫁夫先得巧，明珠论斗金盈箱。\n妾守空闺甘寂寞，苦心不恋东家乐。\n却笑天孙长别离，纵使巧多徒尔为。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55871,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"唐宫行乐词 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"明日内家游上苑，许教斗草赌金钗。\n怕人先记花名字，隔夜潜偷玉篆牌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55872,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"唐宫行乐词 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"华清赐浴晚凉回，水殿芙蓉彻夜开。\n碧盌调冰消酒渴，金盘又进荔枝来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55873,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"调笑词二首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"杨柳，杨柳，一夜绿如春酒。\n今朝起送归人，关山千里暮春。\n暮春，暮春，春暮目断天涯烟树。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55874,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"调笑词二首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"胡蝶，胡蝶，飞绕碧桃千叶。\n今朝走觅南邻，明日天涯暮春。\n暮春，暮春，春暮花落蝶归何处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55875,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刺促词","author":"胡奎","text":"刺促何刺促，夜泊长江曲。\n同是远游人，何须论迟速。\n刺促复刺促，刺促向谁道。\n青青高山树，不如墙下草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55876,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛转词 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"宛宛转转车下轮，红红绿绿百花春。\n纷纷汨汨马蹄尘，寂寂寞寞闺中人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55877,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛转词 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"宛宛转转机上丝，红红绿绿绣为衣。\n纷纷汨汨胡蝶飞，寂寂寞寞人别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55878,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛转词 其三","author":"胡奎","text":"宛宛转转弦上音，红红绿绿陇西禽。\n纷纷汨汨愁人心，寂寂寞寞春闺深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55879,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采菱词","author":"胡奎","text":"江水明于镜，江波皱如縠。\n采菱溪上头，爱此溪水绿。\n昨日采菱去，菱多满载归。\n今日采菱去，叶多菱角稀。\n采菱不采叶，空回木兰楫。\n菱刺牵人衣，江空正愁妾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55880,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲词","author":"胡奎","text":"秋风昨夜起，花落翠房深。\n欲识妾心苦，试尝莲子心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55881,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮萍词","author":"胡奎","text":"半随波浪半黏沙，漂泊东西不恋家。\n莫怪生来无定迹，只缘根本是杨花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55882,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新柳词","author":"胡奎","text":"纤腰袅袅春风前，十五女儿真可怜。\n天气困人眉不展，也随蚕事学三眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55883,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳花词二首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"迎得春来又送归，被他撩乱扑征衣。\n莫教十字街头种，花到开时四散飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55884,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳花词二首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"随风为白雪，入水化青萍。\n无限离人意，长亭又短亭。\n上天如白云，入水化萍叶。\n云萍无定踪，如何不愁妾。\n盈盈墙下桃，花落子留树。\n薄命似杨花，随风不知处。\n朝扑绮罗衣，夕委黄尘道。\n不知长江上，化作浮萍草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55885,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨柳词二首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"扬子江边杨柳条，风前学舞斗纤腰。\n来往游人攀折少，也胜种在灞陵桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55886,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨柳词二首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"袅袅翠腰柔，春来舞到秋。\n郎行莫回顾，中有断肠愁。\n一缕一缕愁，千丝千丝苦。\n宁见章台春，莫逢灞陵雨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55887,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]